msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Time pressed "
"onward,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Le temps a "
"poursuivi son cours,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_E00C943F_4D75_42F5_B79C_13668E56E37E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0933250a14f9cac60fa1496f724a44e4cfeb9c7823b335313ae56e6ba095a3fe
#. default-sha256: ccada48493b2a1850990d46ef2f04df67ffb393665bb9edc08144d6b19481d19
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E00C943F_4D75_42F5_B79C_13668E56E37E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then, at long last, you arrived."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫et un jour, enfin, vous êtes arrivé."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DD418C23_5115_4DCC_BC33_8D2938BF2673
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ba0ea2c73bbd71fce93456b1c16bdf6801ca6c18057e4d48e8b685612ba2905
#. default-sha256: 73df32cd44612828981edaef2cba1fa6af8c54bef68aca5229a121a966502635
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DD418C23_5115_4DCC_BC33_8D2938BF2673"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, splendid...⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You have finally awoken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Ah, parfait...⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Enfin, vous êtes réveillé."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41a60e8de6ef13641375fdd20864bc5572f312e2967c15d87ae05ad0d9b5e7a8
#. default-sha256: 7c26d8fb120261e7d584abdc15396df2a5e4a8bb098f36424e2031d66adb3193
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have simply been waiting so long for this moment."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’est que cela fait si longtemps que j’attends ce moment."

#: scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b61a93870a82c85db293c65615e6dc18a0ab5642866516ec66cf9df11960cdb7
#. default-sha256: bdb5a84dbbb99c520267651bc5c9c6b6bedf6e487e3bbc1c6e042bd8ec28d7cc
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tending to the mansion all by my lonesome,⟪k:1⟫ensuring it was ready for your return, Master—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫whenever that time may be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En m’occupant toute seule du manoir,⟪k:1⟫en m’assurant qu’il soit prêt pour votre retour, "
"Maître—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫quel qu’en soit le moment."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e72d3f692ec9c1f1fe5f36b6271832fa2a8712df5646c7bccdce07a39e48700
#. default-sha256: 195f6860dd66d0043118b8fd04b94ae9007c6435c0683a7388db2ea39da38fd2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I caught sight of you through the window,⟪k:1⟫my heart fluttered. ⟪k:2⟫The time had "
"finally arrived."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quand je vous ai aperçu par la fenêtre,⟪k:1⟫mon cœur n’a fait qu’un bond. ⟪k:2⟫Le temps "
"était enfin venu."

#: scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d27d1e3581876a7d8aa2ac00e453fdb849fbf8b1ee27c17bbb2dff8113aa1cdb
#. default-sha256: 2729a713b80650fb8c296eb55ef54b22cd2123f6a79c9fe0731f4709488e43b5
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh my, you do not know who I am?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do you not know who you are, either?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh ciel, vous ne savez pas qui je suis ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vous ne savez pas non plus qui vous "
"êtes ?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06f0c76a06a5234bfebf5e09d3a2829d2c33a8dade9ed2ef129658411cff70ff
#. default-sha256: b911ddceb3868eac6ad3befcafc5bf2b6e3c75012a20c95286fc86a5138fb855
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That is quite the predicament."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Voilà qui est fâcheux."

#: scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f15b9443e9a82bca3b94077c5af0ed1b1abf26096e934f2656598e13b6b31eee
#. default-sha256: ad2fdfdea82264b20232e4610ace676a16ebc5a4b4df02881727092897866ec8
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Then how about this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bon, j’ai une idée : dites-moi ce que vous en pensez."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33f93d37d4e6d07f502a5ed47551d5cae22f9b466be88a783c915a7dda45ae03
#. default-sha256: c71fa939add5d6cdf6d201f7f0fb9faffa5bc0082fa449d8bd62cc19d4131f01
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am a servant of this mansion, and as such, I am familiar with the many incidents that have "
"taken place here.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I shall show you the history of this house, Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je suis une servante de ce manoir et en tant que telle, je suis au fait des nombreux "
"incidents qui sont survenus ici.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je vous propose de vous montrer l’histoire de cette "
"maison, Maître."

#: scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be499e87b148fcb04ab1a3454e9c0179124c7aaa5053fdde61b64852e0bfa70d
#. default-sha256: c614f0a5ef7f8fa3bf0fab9a627beda96a7b3c7b07a23bc44c825fe99cb1f70b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Let us be off, then.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And fear not—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I merely entreat you not to let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Allons-y, dans ce cas.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Et n’ayez pas peur—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ je vous invite simplement "
"à ne pas me lâcher la main."

#: scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00e18fd03dbb369d551619567037eb6823d784fd305b06ec225aebb671f52e3d
#. default-sha256: 44ad1810f13ccddab54067f60b99543c6fcf2cfc61b1035f950a6588567f6011
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Should you hold it tightly, you need not worry about being washed away by the waves of "
"history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si vous la tenez fermement, nul besoin de vous inquiéter ; vous ne serez pas emporté par les "
"vagues de l’histoire."

#: scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b46186f88490d5dfdcc0756f65424b9d2255a9ee7b4560d44ad29ae0f6a1fa9
#. default-sha256: 3b0176a7216d5ed0ed1fe4228f69cdc7d6914951c0a2448487d60896b59ad424
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No matter what happens, you mustn’t let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quoi qu’il arrive, je vous en prie, ne lâchez pas ma main."

#: scenario6:scenario6_163EC0D0_E2FF_4174_9059_D4A83D451B52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e4b76d58e5cc1ca628838b9ea291ccfd6d675288331270c5158c30d9033fbeb
#. default-sha256: 27e0696d6b47b5fdf1773edd6480acca6e963297b62fb2da4af1be070fe53eab
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_163EC0D0_E2FF_4174_9059_D4A83D451B52"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No matter what happens..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Quoi qu’il arrive..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_4DF94911_E146_44DB_9E37_A31671194188
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85e5b21c857f8dd97d5a3879cb6a772f2392a27d746b5124873e88ea19dfbf38
#. default-sha256: 7df7b8a7af80cffdd39528b1dbea89c8348aacfdc89145ae710e9ba9526024fc
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4DF94911_E146_44DB_9E37_A31671194188"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫no matter what you see..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...quel que soit ce que vous voyez..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_BF129CA0_712B_4687_BB76_D5CAAE6E3137
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e96a5381088d4db301a8b54c44b358d3f832490f154a62f1eb38e1ffdf5a17a0
#. default-sha256: 70ac7259d9d3b05cd879aee57ff0e250ecba4e97f692e995be8847c05acb1f1d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_BF129CA0_712B_4687_BB76_D5CAAE6E3137"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫never again..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...ne me lâchez..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_9CB7481D_46BE_4B1A_ACA9_2845B727CBC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03047e06858d292b2c410e78630111fd8dbb6fae88a2e729fab3dc5f62e17b9c
#. default-sha256: c5239748ede1d3e09c57e27adb85161dfb47b29120deb69e269ef625430ffe32
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9CB7481D_46BE_4B1A_ACA9_2845B727CBC5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫let go of this hand..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...plus jamais la main..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_18E2B9AF_AE3C_41CE_A368_93578918249C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd94d56594af777666247a2e21b53190a9d716d1d3dbb63c10c857a7ce24ae42
#. default-sha256: fd02a5ba4a5e52811e9002c4e91ab05458dde06de03c277f7ee3380372f97c37
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_18E2B9AF_AE3C_41CE_A368_93578918249C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That... ⟪k:5⟫is everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Voilà... ⟪k:5⟫tout."

#: scenario6:scenario6_99153502_C32A_4E03_9DD6_822B712B48DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62dd824ef383e39c5bb87330bb6494a06c6e416d64b507506bcad7eb7a832571
#. default-sha256: 188f365e7425f51354c132147a541f38c9c6c7e37665a932493076d2f153516c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_99153502_C32A_4E03_9DD6_822B712B48DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"

#: scenario6:scenario6_1266F294_ED32_406E_94D6_8CCA1AF6B90C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39b9aa1fd99be43d79b9805895bf0c3e52c495414a78c47ddac855034b29f81a
#. default-sha256: e39934daded08468cedb0aabca9f6364265dc4ec4f7249386e8e7b4c4d93d3d5
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1266F294_ED32_406E_94D6_8CCA1AF6B90C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I prepared a number of things to say when she was finished with her tale,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’avais préparé un certain nombre de choses à lui dire une fois qu’elle aurait fini son "
"histoire,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0CF713FA_806D_4B6A_BAA0_BF374F4C56E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bea67d14f5e17ab83ea1376fab7a45fbf42600162411ad0baf5dc4cdf2b87cb7
#. default-sha256: 65660da3feaef1b6d1c09296cc229ae7504ae2f0673382a9b7ec52456a111c2c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0CF713FA_806D_4B6A_BAA0_BF374F4C56E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I can’t manage to put any of them into words."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫mais là, je n’arrive pas à les mettre en mots."

#: scenario6:scenario6_1F1C88CC_6A6E_4ECC_868A_58408AC2ABA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b47bc97639ac4ce85c0d1d2d8e3a23e3a399d90b49b38b825ca20064d5b8db14
#. default-sha256: 8f5aeac8743610319d5838e3e7880a384f6c8176867e94cdbd72561ecbd7758c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1F1C88CC_6A6E_4ECC_868A_58408AC2ABA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I almost hate myself for thinking it would be so easy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’en viens presque à me détester pour avoir pensé que ce serait si facile."

#: scenario6:scenario6_E53F052F_E604_466B_A462_5229FDF0E856
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b62cc1d874c9e015846fe3048a5581fecad6d0b5875c681675be93160191198b
#. default-sha256: 1ee59d2ef419de1b625006a5462eef9a06c789e3f3051cf60e908d6df8b72139
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E53F052F_E604_466B_A462_5229FDF0E856"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For letting myself hope I could simply pull her back to her old self,⟪k:1⟫accept whatever "
"had happened to her,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour avoir cru que je pourrais simplement faire renaître son ancienne identité, lui faire "
"accepter tout ce qui lui était arrivé,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F3D5627E_7C28_445A_9C3F_932FF496F53E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecb2f02b22be376a39b4e26c85973f9e15c6babe421b5a245bb7ea3e4d97a824
#. default-sha256: 421024a9c5420579d6f3c17c28778096f42b2f702c3bdc53b8d0e2e003ad15bb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F3D5627E_7C28_445A_9C3F_932FF496F53E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫take her hand in mine, and that would solve everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫prendre sa main dans la mienne, dans l’espoir naïf qu’ainsi tout serait résolu."

#: scenario6:scenario6_218D7FBB_C459_4977_BB6A_96B43570A67F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d015a8a820eca37ca6252e9116fb2380e3fcac804361c79488cc6efe754160c
#. default-sha256: f3879586046a5b5293e4ad391d56ba2f09307b021fcd8d302986249bdd726069
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_218D7FBB_C459_4977_BB6A_96B43570A67F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The truth is so much worse than I imagined—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫so much more harrowing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La vérité est bien pire que je ne l’imaginais—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ tellement plus déchirante."

#: scenario6:scenario6_16D0120E_43DD_41D0_A19C_830C0C139E1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 896adecbc2bbdff6e8840ab72d04a958395b3c5c2b7458365941c647cf7f5fe6
#. default-sha256: c8c30993fa4bd1cf11c8b1b7e2fa8a713f8b7ccb0eb0474e19842c465f52bb47
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_16D0120E_43DD_41D0_A19C_830C0C139E1D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was subjected not only to her own terrible fate,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle a été soumise non seulement à son propre destin, absolument horrible,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_581895C7_70CD_4803_BFC6_FB50FAB30442
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3b374ba3c548cda2dc3dc83d7651348e56cb6afb1d3653289c8639d3e141d24
#. default-sha256: 7de8023e9b9a3a9684943ca0a32af98d503d01ef584541ecc7c73ed3a19f52e1
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_581895C7_70CD_4803_BFC6_FB50FAB30442"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but every single one of this house’s tragedies."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫mais en plus à chacune des tragédies de cette maison."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D523CCEA_32F8_4BE3_ADED_A419394BED4D
