msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When her fingers brush against my skin, they feel as frigid as death itself—⟪k:1⟫far colder "
"than anything I have felt from her thus far."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quand ses doigts effleurent ma peau, je les sens aussi glacés que la mort en personne—⟪k:1⟫ "
"bien plus froids que tout ce que j’ai ressenti d’elle auparavant."

